{"updated":"2026-09-09T19:34:16.180Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Republicans put Trump center stage in US midterms gamble. Elsewhere, why are borrowing costs rising across the world?. And US records hottest summer in 132 years. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Israel, and Iran are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 1.5 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 2.9 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 1.6 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 33 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.2 near 76 km ESE of Isangel, Vanuatu. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.17,0.22,0.26,0.31,0.37,0.42,0.45,0.5,0.55,0.57,0.59,0.63,0.65,0.7,0.82,0.92,1.09,1.33,1.45,1.5,1.52,1.54,1.59,1.61,1.64,1.66,1.71,1.75,1.81,1.87,1.92,1.95,2,2.04,2.08,2.1,2.16,2.21,2.24,2.28,2.32,2.36,2.4,2.45,2.5,2.55,2.61,2.68,2.8,2.89,3.04,3.06,3.11,3.13,3.19,3.24,3.3,3.41,3.51,3.56,3.63,3.68,3.73,3.77,3.82,3.87,3.89,3.91,3.96,3.98,4,4.03,4.09,4.13,4.21,4.27,4.34,4.4,4.46,4.52,4.55,4.61,4.63,4.69,4.81,4.96,5.13,5.64,5.7,5.77,5.82,5.86,5.92,5.96,6,6.06,6.12,6.17,6.22,6.28,6.33,6.4,6.44,6.49,6.55,6.61,6.65,6.71,6.77,6.84,6.88,6.94,7,7.06,7.12,7.14,7.19,7.23,7.3,7.45,7.54,7.59,7.64,7.69,7.74,7.84,7.99,8.14,8.22,8.27,8.34,8.39,8.46,8.53,8.58,8.66,8.71,8.77,8.82,8.94,9.01,9.09,9.18,9.36,9.47,9.98,10.1,10.17,10.23,10.28,10.32,10.38,10.41,10.46,10.61,10.65,10.86,10.91,10.98,11.1,11.16,11.2,11.23,11.25,11.29,11.33,11.39,11.44,11.48,11.53,11.57,11.63,11.66,11.68,11.75,11.78,11.94,12.01,12.12,12.2,12.29,12.38,12.47,12.55,12.61,12.63,12.65,12.7,12.75,12.81,12.85,12.89,12.95,12.99,13.04,13.06,13.09,13.11,13.15,13.2,13.28,13.35,13.43,13.55,13.62,13.73,14.25,14.31,14.36,14.4,14.49,14.64,14.81,14.91,14.95,15.02,15